{"type":"message","id":"78278971","parentId":"cc9923a8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T05:43:59.139Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ticket 002 is done: the program is deployed and executable on devnet, a real genesis character exists on-chain with the Core asset and a non-transferable Token-2022 receipt, and the LiteSVM suite is 5/5 green.\n\n## Full test output\n\n```\nrunning 5 tests\ntest test_initialize_character::req01_pda_derives_canonically ... ok\ntest test_initialize_character::req02_and_req03_core_asset_with_attributes ... ok\ntest test_initialize_character::req05_receipt_is_non_transferable ... ok\ntest test_initialize_character::req06_duplicate_character_id_rejected ... ok\ntest test_initialize_character::req07_genesis_state_and_failed_ix_leaves_no_state ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 2.29s\n```\n\n## Every file touched\n\nNew (all inside \"Files in scope\"):\n\n```\ndocs/devnet.md                                                    [new]\nprograms/soulbound/Anchor.toml                                    [new]\nprograms/soulbound/Cargo.toml                                     [new]\nprograms/soulbound/Cargo.lock                                     [new]\nprograms/soulbound/rust-toolchain.toml                            [new]\nprograms/soulbound/.gitignore                                     [new]\nprograms/soulbound/.prettierignore                                [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/Cargo.toml                  [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/src/lib.rs                  [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/src/state.rs                [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/src/error.rs                [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/src/instructions.rs         [new]\nprograms/soulbound/programs/soulbound/src/instructions/initialize_character.rs  [new]\nprograms/soulbound/tests/Cargo.toml                               [new]\nprograms/soulbound/tests/src/lib.rs                               [new]\nprograms/soulbound/tests/src/test_initialize_character.rs         [new]\nprograms/soulbound/tests/fixtures/mpl_core.so                     [new, 836K]\n```\n\nNo tracked file was modified. Nothing written outside the two in-scope paths. I created no `audit/` directory — that's AdaL's to populate, and the doer skill forbids me writing there.\n\nScratch cleaned up: the scaffold's counter code (`increment.rs`, `constants.rs`, `tests/src/test_initialize.rs`), the empty `app/` dir anchor init made, and the npm artifacts from the mint attempt.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n| Criterion | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `anchor build` clean, `target/idl/soulbound.json` exists | ✅ |\n| LiteSVM green: REQ-01, 02, 03, 05, 06, 07 | ✅ 5/5 |\n| Deployed, `solana program show` reports executable | ✅ slot 515950887 |\n| Real genesis character on devnet, explorer link in `docs/devnet.md` | ✅ |\n\nDeploy tx `47b5Skf...Gq`, genesis mint tx `BaswUii...Tff`. On-chain I confirmed independently: asset owned by Core, 234 bytes, carrying `life_stage=born / mood=curious / memory_epoch=0 / trait_vector=genesis:calm,curious,bold`; mint owned by Token-2022 with `\"extension\": \"nonTransferable\"`; ATA holding exactly 1; mint authority revoked.\n\n## The version gate you flagged\n\nPassed — no Anchor downgrade, no silent workaround. anchor-lang `=1.2.1` + mpl-core `0.12.1` + Token-2022 interface 3 compile and work together. The one real trap: mpl-core's optional `anchor` feature drags in anchor-lang 0.31/0.32 alongside 1.2.1 under the same crate name, silently splitting the Solana types. I left the feature off and drive the CPI with `CreateV1Builder::instruction()` + `invoke`. That's documented in `docs/devnet.md` so nobody \"helpfully\" re-enables it.\n\n## Three things you should know\n\n**1. Your ticket's test command doesn't run the LiteSVM suite.** `anchor test --skip-local-validator` with anchor-cli 1.2.1 still tries to deploy to `127.0.0.1:8899` and dies on a missing `ANCHOR_WALLET`. The suite is `cargo test -p tests` (wired to `[scripts] test`). I left `tickets/` untouched — AdaL needs to amend that line, or the verification will look like a failure when it isn't.\n\n**2. The same command has a path bug.** It `cd`s into `programs/soulbound` then greps `docs/devnet.md`, which is two levels up. I ran the intent (grep from repo root) and it works; as literally written it greps a nonexistent file. Also `grep PROGRAM_ID` without `^` there matches fine, but be aware `docs/devnet.md` now contains several lines with that word.\n\n**3. Deploy went through `solana program deploy`, not `anchor deploy`.** `anchor program deploy` failed with `[Error] No random values implementation could be found` — Anchor 1.2.1's JS IDL step is broken against the Node 18 in my image. The underlying SPL deploy used the same program keypair and succeeded. Worth fixing before CI depends on it.\n\n**Not verified:** I did not test `evolve_traits`, `commit_memory_root`, or `crank_heartbeat` — non-goals. The Core asset has no Oracle plugin yet (Ticket 005). The `tests/fixtures/mpl_core.so` is 836K and will be committed; it's a dump of the live Core program so the suite exercises the real binary rather than a mock — say the word if you'd rather fetch it at test time than track it."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"surplus","model":"claude-sonnet-5.5","usage":{"input":126198,"output":2012,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":805,"totalTokens":128210,"cost":{"input":0.252396,"output":0.020120000000000002,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.27251600000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1793166194245,"responseId":"gen-1793166194-qxaTsg1ksJp4PsMJrpwQ","rawStopReason":"stop","durationMs":44894,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
